<title>USA: M-I Drilling Fluids acquires Summit Drilling Fluid.</title>
<headline>M-I Drilling Fluids acquires Summit Drilling Fluid.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>M-I Drilling Fluids LLC said Monday it acquired Summit Drilling Fluids Inc which generated revenues in excess of $10 million in 1996.</p>
<p>Terms of the acquisition were not disclosed.</p>
<p>M-I Drilling Fluids is owned 64 percent by Smith International Inc and 36 percent by Halliburton Co . ((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
